    "experience_clues": "<ul>\n<li class=\"p1\">Every time you roll a <em><strong>desperate action</strong></em> or a <em><strong>zero-dot action</strong></em>, mark xp&nbsp;in that action&rsquo;s attribute.</li>\n<li class=\"p1\">Once per session when you <em><strong>hit a key</strong></em>, mark 1 xp and mark the key.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"p1\">At the end of each session, mark 1 xp (or 2 xp if you really smashed it) if:</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-style: italic;\"><em>You addressed a challenge with <strong>fearless conviction</strong> or <strong>lateral thinking</strong>.</em></li>\n<li style=\"font-style: italic;\"><em>You struggled with issues stemming from a <strong>temporal glitch</strong></em><em>.</em></li>\n</ul>",
